flowchart LR

TF["`TERRAFORM — infrastructure as code
38 AWS resources
same architecture: local services
swapped for managed ones`"]

VPC["`VPC
public and private subnets`"]

EC2["`EC2 — the application
a single instance today
IAM + Session Manager
instead of open SSH`"]

RDS["`RDS PostgreSQL + pgvector
accepts connections ONLY
from the application
no Multi-AZ yet`"]

S3["`S3 — the files
private and versioned`"]

SSM["`SSM PARAMETER STORE
the secrets`"]

OBS["`OBSERVABILITY, SPLIT
Prometheus watches the application
CloudWatch watches the infrastructure`"]

BAK["`BACKUP AND RESTORE
scripts for the database and the files —
the rest of the app can be rebuilt
prepared, but SCHEDULING not
configured yet`"]

HON["`STATED EXPLICITLY
the architecture supports scale and
high availability — this infrastructure
still needs to be provisioned
to actually reach those levels`"]

TF --> VPC
VPC --> EC2
EC2 --> RDS
EC2 --> S3
EC2 --> SSM
EC2 -.- OBS
RDS -.- BAK
S3 -.- BAK
BAK -.- HON

